From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NXForge layer <layer@nxforge.invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:02:15 +0000
Subject: played-pipelines: a rebuilt Mac app bundles the pipelines its player
 built at a draw

--prebake made only the profile's prewarm list (pso_manifest.tsv), so after a
rebuild (a shader chain change) the pipelines a player's sessions had built
mid-play were compiled at a draw again. The R and M rows of the player's
pso_user.tsv (~/Library/Application Support/nxnative/<id>/, the launcher's
DM_PSO_USER) now join the list in the work folder (pso/played_manifest.tsv);
the profile's file is untouched. NXFORGE_PLAYED_PIPELINES=off leaves them out.
---
